  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can release blocked or corrupted ki with ease.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Restore Flow<sup>MIM</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can use this feat as a swift action, and you add your mythic tier to your Wisdom check to negate a non-mythic effect of the types described, or one-half your mythic tier (minimum 1) if the effect is mythic. When you use this feat to remove the dazed, staggered, or stunned condition, the ki point cost is not increased if the effect is a non-mythic effect.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-ki-feats#toc66\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
